{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "App merchant resource creation and profile submissions",
    "version": "2026-11-10",
    "description": "本批实际实现的创建及查询子集。MERCHANT会话，无需选店/商户头；独立经营实体与证照/管理空间分开。经营市场继承账号；证照可为空但引用须已审核且有所有权。支付创建仅USER身份，near-pay以原凭据回查本人ENABLED经营实体；PM档案/typed管理员/创建回执同事务。原键同内容回放、异内容冲突；查询按当前成员授权读取，不恢复已撤权授权。无渠道开通、进件送审、门店绑定或收款资格承诺。新PM可提交FIAT资料进入原运营审批，批准后供既有渠道正式送审读取。待审保留旧批准；BIZ不批准资料或送渠道。新增提交永久回执与审核命令独立，查询按当前typed账号和商户范围。 Payment creation must match the existing SourceMarketPolicy market; the App closes creation for a different account market."
  },
  "paths": {
    "/biz/app/operating-entities/context": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "operatingEntityCreationContext",
        "security": [
          {
            "merchantBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "检查 envelope.code；0 为成功，10400/10403/10404/10409 等为业务拒绝。HTTP 非2xx同样不能读取成功 data。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "code": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "msg": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "market": {
                          "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                          ]
                        },
                        "canCreate": {
                          "type": "boolean"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "market",
                        "canCreate"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "code",
                    "data"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
